---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Privacy & Security - Lupyd" description="At Lupyd, we prioritize your privacy and security with advanced data protection and user-controlled sharing preferences.">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 py-16 md:py-24 lg:py-32 max-w-7xl relative z-10">
    <!-- Page Header -->
    <div class="flex flex-col items-center space-y-4 text-center mb-16 animate-card">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">Privacy & Security</h1>
      <p class="mx-auto max-w-[700px] text-lg md:text-xl text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
        At Lupyd, we prioritize your privacy and security with advanced protection mechanisms and user-controlled settings.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Privacy Cards -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mb-20">
      <!-- Card 1 -->
      <div class="animate-card" style="animation-delay: 0.05s">
        <div class="bg-card/40 border border-border/50 rounded-lg p-8 flex flex-col items-center text-center h-full shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="p-3 bg-primary/10 rounded-full text-foreground mb-4">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-6 w-6"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">Advanced Data Protection</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed flex-1">
            Utilize advanced data protection mechanisms to secure your information. Our multi-layered security approach keeps your data safe.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2 -->
      <div class="animate-card" style="animation-delay: 0.1s">
        <div class="bg-card/40 border border-border/50 rounded-lg p-8 flex flex-col items-center text-center h-full shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="p-3 bg-primary/10 rounded-full text-foreground mb-4">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-6 w-6"><path d="M12.22 2h-.44a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v.18a2 2 0 0 1-1 1.73l-.43.25a2 2 0 0 1-2 0l-.15-.08a2 2 0 0 0-2.73.73l-.22.38a2 2 0 0 0 .73 2.73l.15.1a2 2 0 0 1 1 1.72v.51a2 2 0 0 1-1 1.74l-.15.09a2 2 0 0 0-.73 2.73l.22.38a2 2 0 0 0 2.73.73l.15-.08a2 2 0 0 1 2 0l.43.25a2 2 0 0 1 1 1.73V20a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h.44a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-.18a2 2 0 0 1 1-1.73l.43-.25a2 2 0 0 1 2 0l.15.08a2 2 0 0 0 2.73-.73l.22-.39a2 2 0 0 0-.73-2.73l-.15-.08a2 2 0 0 1-1-1.74v-.5a2 2 0 0 1 1-1.74l.15-.1a2 2 0 0 0 .73-2.73l-.22-.38a2 2 0 0 0-2.73-.73l-.15.08a2 2 0 0 1-2 0l-.43-.25a2 2 0 0 1-1-1.73V4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z"></path><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"></circle></svg>
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">User-Controlled Sharing</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed flex-1">
            Control your data sharing preferences with our user-centric settings. You decide what information is shared and with whom.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3 -->
      <div class="animate-card" style="animation-delay: 0.15s">
        <div class="bg-card/40 border border-border/50 rounded-lg p-8 flex flex-col items-center text-center h-full shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="p-3 bg-primary/10 rounded-full text-foreground mb-4">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-6 w-6"><path d="M1 12s4-8 11-8 11 8 11 8-4 8-11 8-11-8-11-8z"></path><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"></circle></svg>
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">Anonymous Browsing</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed flex-1">
            Browse anonymously with our enhanced privacy options. Explore content without leaving a digital footprint when you choose.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Privacy Commitment Section -->
    <section class="mb-20">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-8 text-center animate-card">Our Privacy Commitment</h2>
      <div class="bg-muted/40 border border-border/20 p-8 rounded-lg animate-card" style="animation-delay: 0.05s">
        <p class="text-muted-foreground mb-8 leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">
          At Lupyd, we believe privacy is a fundamental right. Our platform is built with privacy at its core, not as an afterthought. We are committed to:
        </p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
          <div class="border-l-4 border-primary pl-4 animate-card" style="animation-delay: 0.1s">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-foreground">Transparency</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
              We are clear about what data we collect and how we use it. Our privacy policy is written in plain language, not legal jargon.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="border-l-4 border-primary pl-4 animate-card" style="animation-delay: 0.15s">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-foreground">User Control</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
              You have complete control over your data. We provide easy-to-use tools to manage your privacy settings and data.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="border-l-4 border-primary pl-4 animate-card" style="animation-delay: 0.2s">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-foreground">Data Minimization</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
              We only collect the data necessary to provide our services. We don't collect data for the sake of having more information.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="border-l-4 border-primary pl-4 animate-card" style="animation-delay: 0.25s">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-foreground">Security First</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
              We implement the latest security measures to protect your data from unauthorized access and breaches.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Security Features -->
    <section class="mb-20">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-8 text-center animate-card">Security Features</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
        <div class="animate-card" style="animation-delay: 0.05s">
          <div class="bg-muted/40 border border-border/20 rounded-lg p-6 hover:bg-muted/60 transition-colors">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">End-to-End Encryption</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
              All your messages and sensitive content are protected with end-to-end encryption, ensuring only intended recipients can access them.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="animate-card" style="animation-delay: 0.1s">
          <div class="bg-muted/40 border border-border/20 rounded-lg p-6 hover:bg-muted/60 transition-colors">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">Two-Factor Authentication</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
              Add an extra layer of security to your account with two-factor authentication, preventing unauthorized access even if your password is compromised.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="animate-card" style="animation-delay: 0.15s">
          <div class="bg-muted/40 border border-border/20 rounded-lg p-6 hover:bg-muted/60 transition-colors">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">Regular Security Audits</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
              We conduct regular security audits and vulnerability assessments to identify and address potential security issues before they become problems.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="animate-card" style="animation-delay: 0.2s">
          <div class="bg-muted/40 border border-border/20 rounded-lg p-6 hover:bg-muted/60 transition-colors">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">Data Breach Notifications</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
              In the unlikely event of a data breach, we commit to promptly notifying affected users and taking immediate steps to mitigate any potential harm.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Back Home Link -->
    <div class="flex justify-center animate-card">
      <a
        href="/"
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-sm font-medium transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring bg-primary text-primary-foreground shadow hover:bg-primary/90 h-10 px-6 py-2"
      >
        Back to Home
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
